# Files in this repository are stored as normal Git blobs, NOT via Git LFS.
#
# History: an LFS migration was started in May 2026 but never applied to the
# files - only this attribute file was committed. Declaring `filter=lfs` while
# the blobs are raw makes git run `git-lfs clean` on every file and see a
# difference that does not exist, so `git status` reported all 1,209 wallpapers
# as modified and a careless `git add -A` would have replaced every image with a
# 132-byte pointer.
# The attribute is removed so the repository tells the truth about how it stores
# files. See docs/setup/IOSICONS_WALLPAPER_AUDIT.md for the full investigation.
# Before switching to LFS for real, note that the apps fetch wallpapers from
# raw.githubusercontent.com, which serves the LFS *pointer* rather than the
# image. Moving to LFS therefore requires every wallpaper URL in every
# wallpapers.json to move to media.githubusercontent.com, plus a release of all
# eight apps. Verified empirically, not assumed.
*.webp filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
